{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23489","headline":"欲到东洛得杨使君书因以此报 · 白居易","name":"欲到东洛得杨使君书因以此报","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向公心切向财疎，淮上休官洛下居。\n三郡政能从独步，十年生计复何如。\n使君滩上久分手，别驾渡头先得书。\n且喜平安又相见，其余外事尽空虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}